# No Cursor commit attribution

Never add any of the following to commits, commit messages, or PRs:

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor`
- `Co-authored-by: …cursor…`
- `Made-with: Cursor`
- `Made with Cursor`

Commit author must remain the user's normal `git config user.name` / `user.email` only.
